# PvP Forfeit & Deadlines (API)

- Explicit `POST /api/pvp/battles/{battle}/forfeit` is the only combat abandon path. Room `leave` must not terminate active battles.
- Terminal noncombat endings use `end_reason` `forfeit` or `timeout` with proposed 0/0 XP — never accidental +20/+10 combat rewards.
- Persist UTC `action_deadline_at` on phase transitions; adjudicate only via Laravel + row locks when `PVP_TURN_TIMEOUT_ENABLED=true`.
- WebSocket disconnect/refresh must never forfeit. Redis hints stay best-effort after commit.
- Keep `features.pvp` false until explicit owner release approval.
